// Vitest Snapshot v1, https://vitest.dev/guide/snapshot.html

exports[`corpus > builds the support matrix 1`] = `
"| Feature | practical | rfc5321 | rfc5322 | html5 |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| Letters, digits, and single dots | yes | yes | yes | yes |
| Printable specials like \`+\`, \`/\`, \`=\`, and \`_\` | yes | yes | yes | yes |
| Route characters (\`%\`, \`!\`) | no | yes | yes | yes |
| Leading, trailing, or consecutive dots | no | no | no | yes |
| Local part over 64 characters | no | no | yes | yes |
| Quoted local part | no | yes | yes | no |
| Backslash escapes in a quoted string | no | yes | yes | no |
| Dot-separated atoms and quoted strings mixed | no | no | yes | no |
| Comments | no | no | yes | no |
| Whitespace and line folding between tokens | no | no | yes | no |
| Control characters (obsolete syntax) | no | no | yes | no |
| IPv4 address literal | no | yes | yes | no |
| IPv6 address literal | no | yes | yes | no |
| Other domain literals | no | no | yes | no |
| Domain with no dot | no | no | no | yes |
| TLD outside the IANA set | no | yes | yes | yes |"
`;
